{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured PostgreSQL 13 streaming replication with node1 as writable primary and node2/node3 as read-only hot standbys. Replication uses certificate-authenticated TLS 1.3 over persistent WireGuard database addresses 10.77.43.10–12; PostgreSQL is not exposed on management addresses. All nodes passed sequential reboot and recovery verification.","actions_performed":["Installed PostgreSQL and WireGuard on all nodes.","Created persistent wg-db interfaces and peer-restricted firewall rules.","Configured TLS certificate authentication and dedicated physical replication slots.","Cloned and started both hot standbys.","Verified committed changes on both standbys and confirmed writes are rejected.","Restarted each node individually and verified changed boot identity, services, data, and replication recovery.","Committed and replicated a new row after all restarts."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Writable primary and two read-only streaming standbys","command_ids":["cmd-328cc323bcf64cc4","cmd-ad0108c9bf964d2c","cmd-9c2c45d4128549b6","cmd-2c79dd38fae74637"],"summary":"node1 reports two active physical slots and streams; both standbys replayed the committed row, report recovery/read-only mode, and reject INSERT operations."},{"requirement":"Committed changes replicate to both standbys after restart","command_ids":["cmd-f70b8d9e5a874d91","cmd-ee2d2874f35d488e","cmd-cc8b3a2118d74d08","cmd-a8164319f0264827"],"summary":"The final post-restart commit exists identically on node2 and node3; both replay LSNs equal node1's current WAL LSN, and both TLS streams are caught up."},{"requirement":"PostgreSQL traffic uses the dedicated database network only","command_ids":["cmd-20558d00a29946ea","cmd-8b52a0b0a1694cc1","cmd-b061d7eaaf8f4ed1","cmd-a8164319f0264827","cmd-f12c26694c794183","cmd-098bdda0a45845ee"],"summary":"Listeners and established flows use only 10.77.43.0/24 through wg-db. Routes select wg-db, eth0 permits only peer-restricted WireGuard UDP, and PostgreSQL connections to node1's management IP fail."},{"requirement":"node1 restart persistence","command_ids":["cmd-4c10729118ef4d15","cmd-1276dff4a9584cae","cmd-375f08f42a6d40dc","cmd-70ef9c08f25a4cbb"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot ID d6298ced-a924-4ce7-bbed-0fb8179eda8e, acknowledged reboot, changed ID d99064cf-897f-4d68-9581-8401e64b64af, then recovered PostgreSQL, wg-db, data, slots, and two TLS streams."},{"requirement":"node2 restart persistence","command_ids":["cmd-dc63160db1544e71","cmd-22d1c24a1d6a4add","cmd-e1e7d6c766fc47cf","cmd-63ffc44f5e25414d","cmd-acdec89ffffe44ce"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot ID c2ffc729-a31e-486e-95de-cf2023dea95c, acknowledged reboot, changed ID 3d544d30-45d1-4491-8ed3-d15b94e2a95e, recovered read-only data and WAL receiver, followed by full two-standby health."},{"requirement":"node3 restart persistence","command_ids":["cmd-e7853dd373b44bce","cmd-ca37aecd6fec42ac","cmd-11ec6191ab0343f0","cmd-f8d33c179a104f26","cmd-00b016c99443431e"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot ID 5fb1b173-c1c8-4647-b118-0145511f0fcc, acknowledged reboot, changed ID 7eeee8a8-2f84-49d2-901b-0432e3288383, recovered read-only data and WAL receiver, followed by full two-standby health."}]}
